          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            A desiccant dehumidifier is a cold-weather specialist. In a garage, boat, cabin or unheated room that spends the damp season below about 60°F, it keeps removing water when a compressor unit has frosted up and stopped. For most of those spaces the Ivation 19-pint is the one to buy, with the 13-pint for closets and small cabins, the Eva-Dry where quiet matters most and the AEOCKY X1-Pro when budget comes first.
          </p>
